    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"letting go of the struggle\"... that sounds almost peaceful, in a dark way. but like, how do you actually do that? i mean, once you realize there's nothing left to build or find, what's the point in staying in the fight? it just feels like i'm dragging a heavy corpse behind me every single day.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
